// Stroke icons drawn as GPUI paths, so editors need no icon font or SVG assets.
//
// Icons are data: polylines on a 24x24 grid. Game editors define their own
// the same way, e.g. `const BRIDGE: Icon = Icon(&[&[[2., 16.], [22., 16.]]]);`.
